  "question": {
    "text": "<strong>Paragraph:</strong>\nThe coordination number of $\\mathrm{Ni}^{2+}$ is 4 .\n$\\mathrm{NiCl}_2+\\mathrm{KCN}$ (excess) $\\rightarrow A$ (cyano complex)\n$\\mathrm{NiCl}_2+$ conc. $\\mathrm{HCl}$ (excess) $\\rightarrow B$ (chloro complex)<strong>Question:</strong>\nThe hybridization of $A$ and $B$ are",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ollAf",
      "text": "\n$d s p^2, s p^3$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "WvZwd",
      "text": "\n$s p^3, s p^3$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "xm2vT",
      "text": "\n$d s p^2, d s p^2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "fjXUR",
      "text": "\n$s p^3 d^2, d^2 s p^3$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hybridisation of $\\mathrm{Ni}$ in $\\mathrm{K}_2\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CN})_4\\right]$ is $d s p^2$ and in $\\mathrm{K}_2\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}^2\\left(\\mathrm{Cl}_4\\right)\\right]$ is $s p^3$ (Detail see in question no. 25).",
    "image": null
  },
